window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Waking up after my accident, I discover how far up the creek I am without a paddle. My body and soul defiled, I need to get back to my men, but things take a turn for the better, and my daring rescue becomes a bloody need for revenge.</p> <p>A chance encounter that leads to me figuring out what the Society has in store for me, I’m swept up in a war that will see the city torn into factions, every single one of them out for blood.</p> <p>Book two in the Bleeding Hearts Series.<br> <br> This is a dark contemporary romance with triggering situations and dark themes. Includes scenes of BDSM. Please note that it is set in England with British characters, where there are British English words used in dialogue and inner monologue.</p>"; 
